// Opponent AI pace lock-in (playtest row 99, docs/integration/opponent-pace.md): the
// lantern_checkpoint race from apps/simcli/scenarios/race/pick_lantern_checkpoint.ron,
// police off (no patrols, no presence), traffic as in the race, every seat (the player's
// too) driven by wp_opponent at skill 0.50, each seat's picker personality otherwise.
// simcli cannot drive AI racers: run standalone, the cars wait on the grid and the
// `expect_pending` pace metrics stay pending (unknown to simcli).
// crates/wp_race/tests/opponent_pace.rs::pace_scenarios_hold_their_ranges races it (release
// builds) and checks them: `finishers` (every car finishes), `best_ratio` (best time over
// that car's ideal time: its speed profile at 100 % of its measured limits; at most today's
// + 0.05, never under 0.97), `race_time_s` per car (today's time −15 % .. +15 %, +20 % at
// skill 0.50). Measured 2026-10-20 on lead/opponent-pace; re-measured the same day on the
// round-12 tip (today's grids, residential grid city, police give-way; reasons in
// docs/integration/opponent-pace.md). Re-locked 2026-10-21 on ws/police 3bccc796 + ws/harness +
// lead/round12 (one-version handling); reasons in docs/integration/opponent-pace.md. Re-locked 2026-10-22: best_ratio 2.27 -> 2.44 (today 2.393). It moved
// with D's ws/world traffic merge (already on 4b3d690e, before the traffic-passing AI fixes;
// police are off in this scenario, so not E's police). Re-measure and widen only with a reason.
// Re-locked 2026-10-21 on claude/awesome-faraday-epejyl (playtest row 134: traffic no longer
// emergency-brakes for a racer passing in the next lane): player now 102.1 s (range was 110–155.3), range 102.1 −15 % / +20 %.
// Re-locked 2026-10-22 when the pace harness moved to the browser setup (the player seat stays
// a player car, AI-driven, so traffic spawns round it): best ratio 2.393 -> 1.484, field
// faster: downtown traffic now spawns round the player car instead of all over the city (about 12 civilians within 300 m of each racer before), so the field meets less of it.
// Re-locked 2026-10-23 by the rule for candidate G (the owner's new shipped handling) with the
// AI retune (lead/opponent-pace): this seed's back pair queues behind the front pair at s50
// (+20 s) and runs clear at s95 (−4 s). 16-seed means: s50 72.7 s (pre-G 75.1, 59/64 finish),
// s95 72.0 s (74.9). Reasons in docs/integration/opponent-pace.md "Candidate G".
// Re-locked 2026-10-24 by the rule for RaceConfig::ram_traffic (owner: racers unafraid of
// traffic in a race): no queueing behind downtown civilians or waiting at junctions (juno
// 61.0 -> 41.1 s, dez 62.9 -> 45.3, tito 71.9 -> 48.1, player 96.0 -> 61.8). Reasons in
// docs/integration/opponent-pace.md "Unafraid of traffic".
// Re-locked 2026-10-25 (PR #94): the player seat no longer queues behind a finisher held just
// past the line (finishers keep shoving through for 15 m): 61.8 -> 46.3 s, by the rule
// (-15 % .. +20 %). The other three are in range and keep their locks.
(
    name: "opponent_pace_lantern_checkpoint_s50",
    seed: 31,
    city: preset(
        name: "vesper_v2",
        seed: 1,
    ),
    time_of_day_h: 14.0,
    time_ratio: 1.0,
    mode: Simulation,
    assists: ai,
    traffic_density: 0.2,
    police_presence: 0.0,
    police_cars: false,
    panels: true,
    entities: [
        (
            id: "player",
            car: "lindwurm_4t",
            pos: (-1.75, 257.0, 13.628593),
            yaw: 3.1415927,
            driver: scripted,
            inputs: [],
        ),
        (
            id: "ai_juno",
            car: "shiro_turbo",
            pos: (-1.75, 233.0, 13.628593),
            yaw: 3.1415927,
            driver: scripted,
            inputs: [],
        ),
        (
            id: "ai_dez",
            car: "rampart_50",
            pos: (-1.75, 241.0, 13.628593),
            yaw: 3.1415927,
            driver: scripted,
            inputs: [],
        ),
        (
            id: "ai_tito",
            car: "sperber_32",
            pos: (-1.75, 249.0, 13.628593),
            yaw: 3.1415927,
            driver: scripted,
            inputs: [],
        ),
    ],
    duration_s: 10.0,
    sample_hz: 60.0,
    hash_every: 240,
    expect: [
        total_loss(
            entity: "player",
            expected: false,
        ),
        total_loss(
            entity: "ai_juno",
            expected: false,
        ),
    ],
    expect_pending: [
        metric(name: "finishers", min: 4, max: 4),
        metric(name: "best_ratio", min: 0.97, max: 1.19),
        metric(name: "race_time_s", entity: "ai_juno", min: 35.0, max: 49.4),
        metric(name: "race_time_s", entity: "ai_dez", min: 38.5, max: 54.4),
        metric(name: "race_time_s", entity: "ai_tito", min: 40.9, max: 57.7),
        metric(name: "race_time_s", entity: "player", min: 39.3, max: 55.5),
    ],
)
